# Everything listed here is generated or personal and is rebuilt by the tools;
# docs/BUILD.md section 7 lists what recreates each entry.

# Quarto build outputs. Never commit these: _book/ is ~400 MB (the Kindle
# Previewer .kpf alone is ~260 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so a
# push containing it is rejected), and CI rebuilds and deploys them anyway.
/_book/
/_site/
/.quarto/
# left behind only if tools/build_all.py / check_env.py is interrupted mid-probe
/_book.locktest/
# a failed PDF render can leave the intermediate LaTeX in the project root
/index.tex
# per-document Quarto resource folders (render scratch)
/chapters/*_files/
/appendices/*_files/
/index_files/
/site_libs/

# Claude Code: personal, machine-specific settings (permission rules,
# absolute paths), never shared. To share project settings with others later,
# replace /.claude/ by /.claude/settings.local.json and commit .claude/settings.json.
/.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md

# The reference book this workflow was distilled from, if a copy sits here:
# a separate repository, never part of the template.
/MRI/

# LaTeX intermediates for the Kindle edition's rasterised math
/.kindle-build/
# Portable Java + epubcheck, fetched by `python tools/verify_epub.py --install-tools`
/.tools/

*.html
!_extensions/**/*.html
# theme/*.html are source includes (e.g. mathjax-config.html), not rendered output:
!theme/*.html

# Smoke-test render artifacts (the source smoke-test.qmd is tracked)
/smoke-test.pdf
/smoke-test.tex
/smoke-test_files/

# Scratch/diagnostic files (incl. verifier-agent recompute scripts)
/_*.txt
/_*.pdf
/_*.py
/tools/_*.py
/test_*.qmd
/test_*.html
/test_*_files/

# LaTeX intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg
*.xdv

# The cover is the exception to the rules below: cover.pdf + cover.png are
# committed (built rarely by tools/build_cover.py, needed by every format).

# Diagram intermediates (keep sources, ignore compiled artifacts)
diagrams/**/*.pdf
diagrams/**/*.svg
diagrams/**/*.aux
diagrams/**/*.log
# Per-figure build logs from tools/build_diagrams.ps1 (cleaned on success,
# but ignore them so an interrupted build never leaves them tracked).
*.buildlog

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Fonts are large; document how to fetch them instead of committing (optional)
# fonts/*.ttf

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

**/*.quarto_ipynb
